        <figure class="mt-12 border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
          <blockquote class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight text-ink leading-snug">
            Keeping the AI model away from the moment-to-moment decisions, and using it
            instead to prepare the list of likely names ahead of time, was a decision
            about what kind of mistake is acceptable in a record a licensor may read.
            That decision shows up in how the whole system is built.
          </blockquote>
        </figure>
